ay  26  2021 throughout wickersham's lengthy  comments on the matter she doesn't  mention anything about why she chose to  leave after season 18 of ncis  the most likely explanation is that she  merely wanted to pursue other  opportunities after playing the same  character across eight seasons and 172  episodes  i mean if we worked like regular nine to  five jobs things could be different  being free from the rigors of a network  show's shooting schedule would give her  flexibility in choosing other jobs or  even just taking a break for a while and  enjoying her hard-earned success  but what's most important for fans of  ncis is that it appears as though she's  leaving on good terms with everyone she  worked with  over the last decade they're loose like  the whole cast and cruise like lucy  goosey which makes for like such a nice  work environment it really does  as she mentions on instagram i've been  lucky enough to be a part of a show  where i got to show up and  act and laugh and learn with wonderful  people a moment in time i  surely won't forget thank you cbs and  ncis for including me in a part of  television history  as you go down her post you can see a  slew of comments from her many followers  have already come  in including one from the official cbs  instagram account which posted  thanks for making history with us  wickersham's co-stars including maria  bello and brian dietzen  also use their accounts to express their  pleasure of getting to work with her for  so many years  wickersham is now free to pursue  whatever projects interest her the most  from here on out while it's still  unclear where she'll end up  bright things are inevitably in store  for the talented actress wickersham's  co-stars aren't the only ones sad we  won't see any more of ellie bishop  eating snacks while putting clues  together ncis fans took to twitter in  droves to express their sadness at the  season 18 finale spelling the end of  ellie as well as the much-loved  relationship between ellie and nick  ellie bishop served as an inspiration to  plenty of viewers including one user who  raved about both her favorite character  and the talented actor who plays her  writing maybe some people will never  understand why i'm so devastated but i'm  31 years old i grew up with ncis but i  just connected with one female character  emily wickersham played ellie bishop a  powerful talented persevering and  empowered woman  others talked about how ellie had  impacted their lives beyond the small  screen  influencing the real world in a very  real way one person wrote thank you  emily wickersham for creating such an  amazing character  one that inspired me to pursue a career  in intelligence myself  fans will miss you but i think i speak  for all of us when i say there's only  one ellie bishop check out one of our  newest videos right here plus even more  looper videos about your favorite stuff  for coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one  [Music]  you

